Scalars third-party attributions
=================================

This file lists portions of Scalars' own source (under include/ and src/)
that are copied or adapted from other projects, together with the license
each portion is distributed under. It is separate from ThirdParty/, which
holds vendored dependencies in their own directories with their own
LICENSE files.

