4. Eigen (MPL-2.0)
------------------

File:
  - include/backend/cpu/detail/vector_math.h

The vectorized elementary functions in this file (log, log1p, log2, log10,
exp, expm1, exp2, sin, cos, tan, asin, acos, atan, sinh, cosh, tanh, asinh,
acosh, atanh, cbrt, pow, erfc, ndtri, and the frexp/ldexp and double-word
helpers they use) are ported from Eigen (https://gitlab.com/libeigen/eigen),
Eigen/src/Core/arch/Default/GenericPacketMath*.h and
unsupported/Eigen/src/SpecialFunctions/SpecialFunctionsImpl.h. Eigen's exp and
log initially come from Julien Pommier's sse_mathfun, and several kernels and
ndtri from the Cephes Math Library by Stephen L. Moshier.

